{'symbol': 'CAH', 'date': '2021-04-07 10:00:00', 'title': 'CARDINAL HEALTH LAUNCHES NAVISTA™ TS TO HELP ONCOLOGY PRACTICES IMPROVE PATIENT CARE, LOWER COSTS AND DRIVE SUCCESS IN VALUE-BASED CARE', 'text': 'DUBLIN, OHIO, APRIL 7,\xa02021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- CARDINAL HEALTH (NYSE: CAH) SPECIALTY SOLUTIONS TODAY LAUNCHED CARDINAL HEALTH™ NAVISTA™ TECH SOLUTIONS (TS), AN ADVANCED SUITE OF TECHNOLOGY SOLUTIONS TO HELP COMMUNITY ONCOLOGISTS IMPROVE OUTCOMES AND COSTS ASSOCIATED WITH PATIENT TREATMENT AS THEY TRANSITION TO VALUE-BASED CARE.\xa0 "COMMUNITY-BASED ONCOLOGY PRACTICES ARE FACING UNPRECEDENTED PRESSURE AS THEY PIVOT TO ADAPT TO VALUE-BASED REIMBURSEMENT MODELS," SAID HEIDI HUNTER, PRESIDENT OF CARDINAL HEALTH SPECIALTY SOLUTIONS.'}